B.GG=new A.af(B.abo,["Satoshi Index","Settings","Dark mode","Display prices in sats","Replaces 0.00 00X XXX \u20bf with X XXX sats","Display currency","Used on the home screen, in tools and widgets.","Custom prices","My products","Language","French","English","Spanish","Tip me in Bitcoin","Unable to load the Bitcoin price.","Try again","Tools","Sat \u21c4 BTC","Add a personal product"," \xb7 custom price"," \xb7 personal","custom price","personal","Euro","US Dollar","British Pound","Swiss Franc","Canadian Dollar","Australian Dollar","Japanese Yen","Chinese Yuan","Hong Kong Dollar","Singapore Dollar","Russian Ruble","Israeli New Shekel","Search for a currency","No matching currency.","Clear","Baguette","SP95 Gasoline (L)","Pack of Cigarettes","Pack of Cigarettes","Beer (50 cl)","Coffee","Beef (kg)","Beef (kg)","Pizza","Big Mac (euro area)","Gold (1 g)","Ethereum (1 ETH)","Real Estate (m\xb2)","Real Estate (m\xb2)","Universal converter","Satoshis","Bitcoin","Euros","Compare with:","Equivalent purchasing power","Reference unit price","Custom unit price","Live unit price","instantly.","the other three are calculated ","Reference price: ","Your usual price","Leave blank to use the reference price","Use the reference price","Reset all","Reset prices?","All products will use their latest quarterly reference price again.","Cancel","Reset","All custom prices were removed.","Enter a price greater than zero.","Saving\u2026","Save prices","Enter the price you actually pay. Leave a field blank to use the latest quarterly reference price.","These values are stored in euros and used on the home screen, in tools and widgets. Historical pages and charts remain unchanged.","Empty slot \xb7 Add a name, emoji and price","Edit","Delete","Delete this product?","The personal product was deleted.","Product name","Example: Croissant","Emoji or symbol","Example: \ud83e\udd50","Usual price","Example: 1.60","Price currency","Save product","A name is required.","Add an emoji or symbol.","Enter a price greater than zero.","The price is stored in its original currency and automatically converted into the display currency.","They will appear at the bottom of the home screen, in the Tools page and in Android widgets.","Buy Bitcoin","Bull Bitcoin is a non-custodial service for buying and selling Bitcoin.","Unlike centralized platforms such as Binance or Coinbase, Bull Bitcoin never holds your bitcoin.\nYou receive it directly in your personal wallet.\nYou therefore retain full control of your private keys.","You can buy bitcoin in a few minutes by bank transfer.","Go to Bull Bitcoin","Understanding the satoshi","The satoshi, or sat, is the smallest unit of Bitcoin, similar to a cent for the euro.\nUnderstanding this scale makes the prices displayed in satoshis easier to grasp.","Learn about Bitcoin for free on planb.network.","Read the Bitcoin White Paper","Satoshi to Bitcoin","Bitcoin White Paper","Download PDF","PDF downloaded successfully \u2705","Use the PDF viewer download button.","Download folder unavailable","Thank you for your support ","Address copied to the clipboard!","Scan to send a Bitcoin tip","Satoshi Index is an educational application for visualizing how everyday prices evolve in euros (\u20ac) and bitcoin (\u20bf), expressed in satoshis.\nIt offers interactive charts and a quarterly data table, helping users understand inflation and purchasing power through the lens of Bitcoin.","Product price in BTC","Product price in \u20ac","Detailed data","Year","Price in BTC (log)","Price in \u20ac","BTC price","Price in sats","The displayed data is updated quarterly and comes from public sources such as INSEE for consumer prices and CoinGecko for the bitcoin price. ","In some cases, raw data is adjusted to match a more meaningful unit. ","For example, the bread price is calculated from a price per kilogram and converted to the average price of a 250 g baguette. ","Likewise, the beer price represents a pint (50 cl), while the INSEE source reports the price for 25 cl. ","View the ","source"," for more details.","Invalid CoinGecko response","Market prices are missing","Unable to retrieve BTC/ETH prices and no cache is available","Bitcoin chart","Bitcoin price","Refresh","Loading\u2026","Loading...","No data available.","Back","Close","Copy","Open","Download","Share","Source","Quarter","Price","BTC price (\u20ac)","Product price (\u20ac)","Product price (BTC)","Use logarithmic scale","Logarithmic scale","Linear scale","About","Resources","Buy","Learn","Donate","Previous page","Next page","Configuration required","Refresh required","Tap the widget","Refreshing\u2026","Waiting for the first rate","Product deleted","Tap to choose","another product","Offline","No product available.","Configure widget","Displayed item","Appearance","Classic \xb7 solid background","Transparent \xb7 white text","Transparent \xb7 black text","Save widget","Choose the item and the style that suits your wallpaper.","Unable to write widget diagnostics: "],t.w)
